<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1980</h1><p class="ref-lede">1980 in world history: 24 events, 3 births, 22 deaths, 1 work, 2 states founded and 2 that came to an end. 252 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
